## Docker Deployment

### Prerequisites

- Docker and Docker Compose installed
- Environment variables configured

### Local Development with Docker

1. Build and start all services:
```bash
docker-compose up --build
```

2. Services will be available at:
- Dashboard: http://localhost:4200
- Website: http://localhost:4201
- API: http://localhost:4202
- PostgreSQL: localhost:5432
- Redis: localhost:6379

### Production Docker Deployment

1. Build images:
```bash
docker build -f apps/api/Dockerfile -t <%= projectName %>-api .
docker build -f apps/dashboard/Dockerfile -t <%= projectName %>-dashboard .
docker build -f apps/website/Dockerfile -t <%= projectName %>-website .
```

2. Push to registry:
```bash
docker tag <%= projectName %>-api your-registry/<%= projectName %>-api:latest
docker push your-registry/<%= projectName %>-api:latest
```

3. Deploy using docker-compose or Kubernetes.

