## Environment Variables

### API (.env)

```env
# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/<%= projectName %>_db

# Redis (optional)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# JWT
JWT_SECRET=your-super-secret-jwt-key-change-this

# Server
PORT=4202
NODE_ENV=production

# CORS
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4200,http://localhost:4201,https://your-dashboard.com,https://your-website.com

# Stripe (if using)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
```

### Dashboard (.env)

```env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4202
# or production: https://api.your-domain.com
```

### Website (.env)

```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4202
NEXT_PUBLIC_DASHBOARD_URL=http://localhost:4200
# or production:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DASHBOARD_URL=https://dashboard.your-domain.com
```

